ob\\nunder the package, so a bytecode-writing run would redden the\\nsuite it measures.\\n\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 979,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 245,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
