 R | R | R | N-media-bound-build/decode, N-heads-item-build/decode¹ |\\n| heads sorted-unique (10744) | R | R | — | — | N-heads-dup, N-heads-count-build/decode |\\n| evidence order (10752) | R | R | — | — | N-evidence-dup |\\n| evidence count (10747) | R | R | — | — | N-evidence-count |\\n| findings count (10775) | — | — | R | R | N-findings-count-build/decode |\\n| uint53/number model (10743) | R | R | — | — | N-parse-count-edge (Decode ceiling delegated²) |\\n| scalars UUID/digest | R | R | R | R | N-scalar-digest-build/decode, N-uuid-build/decode |\\n| owner nesting (tuple/binding/findings) | R | R | R | R | delegated bound (wiring: delegation table + reachability) |\\n| extensions closed | R | R | R | R | delegated bound (wiring: delegation table + reachability) |\\n| JCS identity (10738, 10759) | C | V | C | V | N-relabel-admit |\\n| mode authority (10753-10754, 10580, 3796-3797) | R | R | — | — | N-mode-auth-build/decode, N-purpose-source |\\n| read-ref binding (10761-10762) | — | — | R | R | N-report-refs-build/decode |\\n| sibling seal (10755, 10581 \\\"aggregates both reads\\\") | M | M | R | R | N-seal-build/decode |\\n| UTF-8 Build strings | R | n/a | R | n/a | N-utf8-lone |\\n| owner-row census empty | — | — | — | — | P-census-entry (plant) |\\n| no fork literals/selectors | — | — | — | — | P-forked-literal, P-severity-second (plants) |\\n| no literal member lists in tests | — | — | — | — | P-guard-literal-list (plant) |\\n| report entries take only sealed siblings | — | — | R | R | P-seal-param-struct, P-seal-param-digest (plants) |\\n| seal unforgeable (no fields/ctors, zero refused) | — | — | R | R | P-seal-ctor, P-seal-exported-field (plants) |\\n| no generated bytecode in package | — | — | — | — | hygiene test (no plant; enforced, not gated) |\\n\\n¹ Single-member native-ID bound narrowings are masked by the\\nsibling bound under the equality constraint (withdrawn row\\nN-session-bound, log preserved); the 512/513 edges are proven\\ndirectly at both