{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d049","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d536-7d14-7863-b4a5-d6cfb7bdb4fc"},"sequence":1663,"recorded_at":1780531400003321,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f8f39da6-44fd-4b55-a795-0893d87482b7","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f8f39da6-44fd-4b55-a795-0893d87482b7","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f8f39da6-44fd-4b55-a795-0893d87482b7"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d554-f604-7aa1-b298-9bd27b732298"},"task_id":"01a0d554-f604-7aa1-b298-9bd27b732298","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d554-f604-7aa1-b298-9bd27b732298","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-59-1\",\n  \"command\": \"task-board m 'set_notes(TASK-260924-2zboyz, text=\\\"RUN-260924-24be9f re-verification for rev6 handoff: worktree byte-identical to rev5 patch (sha256 e0f422.., rev4 identical); NO source changes. Reran myself, all exit 0: leaf suite (74 PASS/0 FAIL), cover 95.6%, determinism -count=3, leaf -race, 5 owner suites + per-package zero-edge check, vet, windows vet, gofmt, mutant battery x2 (43 KILLED / 1 SURVIVED control / 9 RED, failures=0, seal kills audited from raw logs), full 49/49 suite in bounded shards+alones, independent Python JCS recomputation 3/3. Scratch tree OID cf13fcb5 stable; trunk unmoved (no refresh); no registry edit; no pyc. Attached retry-note-rev5.md + retry-logs-rev5.tar.gz (29.7 KiB), both read back OK. Ready for review.\\\")' 2>&1 | head -n 10\",\n  \"description\": \"Set final board notes\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-2zboyz\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"spawn workload selection: class=implementation source=explicit policy=spawn.workload_classes pair=muse/muse-spark/max pair_source=explicit match=recommended_rank_1 snapshot=sha256:12703c4ea40d4bba69ef5e32089d666fbbcc482e0bd7b83006fefd0daca183ea rationale=\\\\\\\"Chain 3 next leaf: read-back manifest + validation report schemas (split from 1esv6u) after 3n78rv checkpoint; muse max.\\\\\\\"\\\\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: muse via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[muse,codex,claude], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\\\\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260924-e8bdcc, max_parallel=20)\\\\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260924-e8bdcc)\\\\nCandidate ready: internal/clonereadback (14 files, all new). 38 tests green, coverage 94.8%, importer set green, vet+windows vet+gofmt clean, mutant battery 30 rows x2 runs failures=0 (24 narrowings killed, 1 control survived, 5 plants red; 1 masked row withdrawn with log). Full suite running; evidence packing next.\\\\nPre-handoff: DoD 9 vacuous (no production gate inspects source text; AST pins are tests, attacked by P-plants); DoD 13 findings ride TASK-260924-2zboyz_results.md + TRACEABILITY (no control-root LOGBOOK edit per run boundary). Coverage-map precondition: brief carries no surface table (brief gap, reported); gate x entry table covers every gate. Out-of-contract rows: 5 stated bounds in results.md. Diff bounded to new internal/clonereadback/; no registry edit; task_delta.\\\\nCorrection: vacuous-source-text note applies to DoD 10 (no production source-text gate), not 9; DoD 9 narrowings all killed. DoD 14 findings ride the outcome resources per run boundary.\\\\nspawn run child final message (run=RUN-260924-e8bdcc, tools=141 patches=51 failed=1):\\\\nHandoff accepted — TASK-260924-2zboyz is ready for review (`to-review`, checklist 14/14, three outcome artifacts attached and byte-verified on readback).\\\\n\\\\nWhat was built: new package `internal/clonereadback/` (14 files, no landed file touched) implementing Clone Read-Back Evidence Manifest 1.0.0 and Clone Validation Report 1.0.0 as closed schemas with JCS identities per pinned SPEC v0.7.0 §13.14.2. AC coverage is 6 of 6 row